[[File:Ot001 o en.png]]
:''Cat Cannon ATK increased!''
The '''Energy Core''' is the ninth [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]. Like the [[Cosmic Energy]] with which it stacks, it increases the damage dealt by the [[Cat Cannon]].

==Effect==
Each Energy Core increases Cat Cannon ATK by a maximum +500.

When a player has activated Energy Core at 100% in all three chapters, Cat Cannon ATK is increased by +1,500.

