==Trivia==
*In the Japanese version, the Energy Core's equivalent is the '''Spirit of Tōhoku''' (東北の魂), Tōhoku being a region of the Japanese island of Honshu.
**In the [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|original English version]], it was shortened to just '''Spirit'''.
